m3-art 2026-11-26: nuke_w.png / nuke_b.png = the single shared chess.com custom "Nuke" piece (was 8 identical-art 160 px copies in assets/modes/<id>/nuke_*.png, deduped; every mode now points here). nuke_w keyed off the video's own thumbnail art research/frames/sprites/JW9VnzQocLk_nuke.png (400 px, purple tile) with tools/m3art_key.py key_outlined (border flood outside the black outline, projection edge alpha, hard ~1.5 px ramp), 512 px centred at 90%. nuke_b = the same art in the old black crops' style (body #222, light outline #ececec, mid shade), luminance map in tools/m3art_key.py recolor_lum.
